+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+Nothing is recorded in this project regarding a password hashing algorithm decision. This repository (Gin, an HTTP web framework) contains no ADR, policy document, or configuration specifying a password hashing algorithm; its only password-related code (`auth.go`) implements HTTP Basic Auth header construction, which does not hash passwords.
